亭。健遣馬流、陶陽等往攻之。閎與祈等逆擊，大破之，斬首二千餘級。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"衆","kind":"person","person_id":"jfc_0dt_42a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"衆","kind":"person","person_id":"jfc_0dt_42a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"範明","kind":"person","person_id":"ucn_xje_aoy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"衆","kind":"person","person_id":"jfc_0dt_42a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0090","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"衆","kind":"person","person_id":"jfc_0dt_42a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"明","kind":"person","person_id":"ucn_xje_aoy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"明","kind":"person","person_id":"ucn_xje_aoy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"健","kind":"person","person_id":"8f5_74b_457","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0120","start":120,"end":121,"surface":"健","kind":"person","person_id":"8f5_74b_457","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-guzhong:line122:m0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"錢弘","kind":"person","person_id":"znm_0tz_gyy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id"